OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy for
OL,6,Fmost, with showers across northern
OL,7,FEngland and the southwest. Clear skies
OL,8,Ffor some, mainly in the north and
OL,9,Fwest, under which fog and frost may
OL,10,Fdevelop. Feeling cold under any clear
OL,11,Fskies and for breezy eastern coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FVariable cloud with the odd
OL,14,Fbrighter spell. Drizzly showers,
OL,15,Ffocused around the northeast.
OL,16,FTemperatures near average for the time
OL,17,Fof year, but feeling cooler along
OL,18,Fbreezy eastern coasts.
